rovisional","interpretation_note":"完整單元逐段敘述及引語角色覆核；原稱不改，具體判讀見reading-review。"}],"chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p002","text":"轉振威將軍，領監曹奏事令，又為直寢，遷太子步兵校尉。高祖南征，以津為都督征南府長史，至懸瓠，徵加直閤將軍。後從駕濟淮，司徒誕薨，高祖以津送柩還都。遷長水校尉，仍直閤。景明中，世宗遊於北邙，津時陪從，太尉、咸陽王禧謀反，世宗馳入華林。時直閤中有同禧謀，皆在從限。及禧平，帝顧謂朝臣曰：「直閤半為逆黨，非至忠者安能不預此謀？」因拜津左中郎將。遷驍騎將軍，仍直閤。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","source_position":{"revision_id":2087998,"raw_start":10080,"raw_end":10259,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_character_offsets":[10080,10081,10082,10083,10084,10085,10086,10087,10088,10089,10090,10091,10092,10093,10094,10095,10096,10097,10098,10099,10100,10101,10102,10103,10104,10105,10106,10107,10108,10109,10110,10111,10112,10113,10114,10115,10116,10117,10118,10119,10120,10121,10122,10123,10124,10125,10126,10127,10128,10129,10130,10131,10132,10133,10134,10135,10136,10137,10138,10139,10140,10141,10142,10143,10144,10145,10146,10147,10148,10149,10150,10151,10152,10153,10154,10155,10156,10157,10158,10159,10160,10161,10162,10163,10164,10165,10166,10167,10168,10169,10170,10171,10172,10173,10174,10175,10176,10177,10178,10179,10180,10181,10182,10183,10184,10185,10186,10187,10188,10189,10190,10191,10192,10193,10194,10195,10196,10197,10198,10199,10200,10201,10202,10203,10204,10205,10206,10207,10208,10209,10210,10211,10212,10213,10214,10215,10216,10217,10218,10219,10220,10221,10222,10223,10224,10225,10226,10227,10228,10229,10230,10231,10232,10233,10234,10235,10236,10237,10238,10239,10240,10241,10242,10243,10244,10245,10246,10247,10248,10249,10250,10251,10252,10253,10254,10255,10256,10257,10258],"projection_sha256":"58e3a4ab731cf79063a76ff14f9c2a3b108d3a2ab7e4fcb3fbefec6bf0b884f7"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p002:m0026","kind":"person","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"高祖","person_id":"8dc_745_f37","status":"contextual_prov